1
00:00:04,495 --> 00:00:10,330
(Tsumura) Because of me, you and Kento were targeted.

2
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:15,726
(Yuri) Huh? What do you mean?

3
00:00:15,726 --> 00:00:18,924
it is…

4
00:00:18,924 --> 00:00:22,528
7 years ago we...

5
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:24,858
were supposed to get married

6
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:32,132
♬〜

7
00:00:32,132 --> 00:00:35,363
what do you mean?

8
00:00:37,825 --> 00:00:45,297
Me and... Tsumura-san?

9
00:00:45,297 --> 00:00:49,297
Haha... that can't be true, right?

10
00:00:49,297 --> 00:00:52,561
Because Yusuke and I...

11
00:00:54,396 --> 00:00:56,495
Yusuke?

12
00:00:56,495 --> 00:00:58,726
what did you do?

13
00:00:58,726 --> 00:01:00,726
Huh?

14
00:01:01,924 --> 00:01:03,660
What do you mean?

15
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:06,264
This guy is...

16
00:01:06,264 --> 00:01:09,099
I'm a Neurovis person.

17
00:01:11,297 --> 00:01:14,165
Did you mess with her memory too?

18
00:01:14,165 --> 00:01:16,165
Huh?

19
00:01:17,495 --> 00:01:20,330
lie

20
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:22,330
Yusuke...

21
00:01:24,396 --> 00:01:26,858
That's a lie, right?

22
00:01:30,165 --> 00:01:32,726
(Ninomiya) He's right.

23
00:01:38,924 --> 00:01:42,561
Me and Yuri...

24
00:01:42,561 --> 00:01:45,066
There was nothing

25
00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:53,660
We're just classmates from elementary school who happened to meet again at university.

26
00:01:56,924 --> 00:01:59,429
Sigh...

27
00:02:01,924 --> 00:02:07,594
My… memories?

28
00:02:09,924 --> 00:02:11,594
why?

29
00:02:11,594 --> 00:02:13,924
It's for you

30
00:02:13,924 --> 00:02:16,693
To keep you from becoming the wife of a murderer

31
00:02:16,693 --> 00:02:21,165
I erased Tsumura's incident and his memory.

32
00:02:23,066 --> 00:02:25,330
That's not all.

33
00:02:35,594 --> 00:02:38,429
I didn't just erase my memory.

34
00:02:38,429 --> 00:02:42,660
I rewritten the memories of me and Yuri into memories of you.

35
00:02:50,330 --> 00:02:52,891
Did you do it on your own will?

36
00:02:55,396 --> 00:02:58,198
Only I can rewrite memories

37
00:03:01,066 --> 00:03:03,594
That's a technique I created.

38
00:03:03,594 --> 00:03:10,066
So... Nanami Ishino's memories are also yours?

39
00:03:10,066 --> 00:03:11,759
ah

40
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:14,066
Memories of Muroya too

41
00:03:21,825 --> 00:03:24,594
Don't be silly, it's your fault!

42
00:03:24,594 --> 00:03:29,726
What about the wise man? What about the wise man?

43
00:03:31,891 --> 00:03:34,231
not my child

44
00:03:36,297 --> 00:03:37,957
Huh?

45
00:03:39,462 --> 00:03:44,660
Then... forever...

46
00:03:47,033 --> 00:03:50,594
So you were cheating on me and Kento?

47
00:03:53,792 --> 00:03:56,000
why?

48
00:03:59,660 --> 00:04:01,825
To you...

49
00:04:03,429 --> 00:04:05,891
To you...

50
00:04:10,033 --> 00:04:12,297
I just wanted you to look at me

51
00:04:12,297 --> 00:04:19,066
♬〜

52
00:04:19,066 --> 00:04:21,066
《Hehe...》

53
00:04:21,066 --> 00:04:26,264
♬〜

54
00:04:26,264 --> 00:04:28,660
《Together forever...》

55
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:31,000
《Let's be together》

56
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,660
《Let's go》

57
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:34,957
《Please be careful when you go》

58
00:04:34,957 --> 00:04:52,033
♬〜

59
00:04:52,033 --> 00:04:55,429
you are not the police

60
00:04:58,099 --> 00:05:01,165
Not a wise father

61
00:05:04,462 --> 00:05:08,627
I…

62
00:05:08,627 --> 00:05:12,000
Not even the person I loved

63
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,693
Well then...

64
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:22,099
Well then...

65
00:05:22,099 --> 00:05:26,132
Who the hell are you?

66
00:05:31,429 --> 00:05:34,594
It wasn't supposed to be like this...

67
00:05:34,594 --> 00:05:38,264
(cry)

68
00:05:45,231 --> 00:05:59,462
♬〜

69
00:05:59,462 --> 00:06:01,561
Yuri

70
00:06:04,726 --> 00:06:09,825
I should have told you sooner, but I was thinking about Yuri...

71
00:06:09,825 --> 00:06:16,099
I can't believe anything anymore...

72
00:06:16,099 --> 00:06:33,759
♬〜

73
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:36,462
Mom?

74
00:06:36,462 --> 00:06:39,033
Sage...

75
00:06:40,198 --> 00:06:42,924
ah…

76
00:06:42,924 --> 00:06:46,429
good

77
00:06:46,429 --> 00:06:52,000
It's okay, you did your best

78
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,297
(Sage) What about daddy?

79
00:06:55,297 --> 00:06:59,330
dreamed

80
00:06:59,330 --> 00:07:08,000
Mom and Dad... go to the sea park...

81
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:11,264
♬(3 people)《I'm hungry》

82
00:07:11,264 --> 00:07:15,264
♬〜

83
00:07:15,264 --> 00:07:17,264
Mom?

84
00:07:17,264 --> 00:07:37,264
♬〜

85
00:07:37,264 --> 00:07:50,693
♬〜

86
00:07:50,693 --> 00:07:53,165
What about Muroya?

87
00:07:53,165 --> 00:07:54,825
I ran away

88
00:07:54,825 --> 00:07:56,726
What about your son?

89
00:07:59,264 --> 00:08:01,264
it's okay

90
00:08:01,264 --> 00:08:11,528
♬〜

91
00:08:11,528 --> 00:08:13,594
It's stable

92
00:08:13,594 --> 00:08:16,759
I think I'll wake up in about two days.

93
00:08:16,759 --> 00:08:18,693
(Kousaka) Thank you

94
00:08:21,726 --> 00:08:23,924
It's okay now

95
00:08:26,759 --> 00:08:32,495
Muroya, please do something about it.

96
00:08:32,495 --> 00:08:37,330
are you okay?

97
00:08:37,330 --> 00:08:39,330
Yeah

98
00:08:53,264 --> 00:08:56,165
Sorry for being late in telling you

99
00:08:56,165 --> 00:08:58,957
Apparently they are growing well in that facility.

100
00:09:04,165 --> 00:09:06,033
What happened?

101
00:09:09,132 --> 00:09:13,660
Ninomiya was rewriting your memory.

102
00:09:16,891 --> 00:09:18,891
yes…

103
00:09:27,792 --> 00:09:30,033
finish it all

104
00:09:33,792 --> 00:09:37,858
Kento... ah...

105
00:09:37,858 --> 00:09:42,297
No... you did a great job.

106
00:09:42,297 --> 00:09:44,759
Yeah

107
00:09:44,759 --> 00:09:47,165
Good hahahaha

108
00:09:47,165 --> 00:09:50,396
Kento: I'll go talk to Uncle Osamu in a bit.

109
00:09:50,396 --> 00:09:53,429
Can you wait for me?

110
00:09:53,429 --> 00:09:55,429
(Sage) Yeah

111
00:09:58,198 --> 00:10:00,660
Why were you silent?

112
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:04,594
Tsumura-san and I were supposed to get married.

113
00:10:04,594 --> 00:10:07,033
There's no way I didn't know

114
00:10:07,033 --> 00:10:11,000
Did you know that my memories have been rewritten?

115
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:14,132
tell me what are you talking about

116
00:10:14,132 --> 00:10:18,561
Yuri: You know... about your mother too.

117
00:10:18,561 --> 00:10:20,231
Huh?

118
00:10:20,231 --> 00:10:24,099
About when my mother died...

119
00:10:24,099 --> 00:10:29,132
Even if I tried to remember, I couldn't remember

120
00:10:29,132 --> 00:10:36,264
But when Kento was attacked, I only saw it for a moment.

121
00:10:36,264 --> 00:10:39,165
Mom isn't sick...

122
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:44,099
He died in the fire, no, no...

123
00:10:44,099 --> 00:10:49,792
I don't want to live without knowing the truth.

124
00:10:49,792 --> 00:10:53,099
I don't need fake memories

125
00:10:56,330 --> 00:10:58,495
please

126
00:10:58,495 --> 00:11:07,627
♬〜

127
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:25,924
(Osamu) I was on my way home from the piano...

128
00:11:25,924 --> 00:11:28,198
(Masami)《Did you play it for me? " "Yeah"

129
00:11:28,198 --> 00:11:30,264
(Female)《Isn't it a fire after all? 》

130
00:11:30,264 --> 00:11:33,330
《What should I do? What should I do?》 《What is it? 》

131
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:37,924
(Female)《Second floor? The fire...》

132
00:11:37,924 --> 00:11:40,066
(Male)《I contacted you, right? 》 《Even if》

133
00:11:40,066 --> 00:11:42,660
(Male) 《Not at all... yet? Firefighting》

134
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:44,759
(Female)《There is still a child inside》

135
00:11:44,759 --> 00:11:47,462
(Male)《What? 》 (Female)《What should I do...》

136
00:11:47,462 --> 00:11:51,759
《Yuri, wait a minute》 《Eh...》

137
00:11:53,264 --> 00:11:55,528
(Male) 《Hey, what are you doing? 》

138
00:11:58,165 --> 00:12:00,693
(Female)《No! " "mother! 》

139
00:12:02,099 --> 00:12:05,627
"mother! 》

140
00:12:05,627 --> 00:12:08,924
(Osamu) You blamed yourself.

141
00:12:08,924 --> 00:12:12,561
Unless you say you want to learn piano...

142
00:12:12,561 --> 00:12:17,000
If I had gone home alone without asking to be picked up...

143
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:21,891
If I had stopped my mother then...

144
00:12:21,891 --> 00:12:24,693
(cry)

145
00:12:24,693 --> 00:12:28,198
you stopped laughing

146
00:12:28,198 --> 00:12:34,462
I wonder how I forgot about that...

147
00:12:34,462 --> 00:12:40,726
Also… Yusuke?

148
00:12:40,726 --> 00:12:45,627
Yeah, it's better to forget

149
00:12:45,627 --> 00:12:50,363
You'll be happier if you don't know

150
00:12:50,363 --> 00:12:53,858
That's what I thought

151
00:12:56,528 --> 00:12:59,165
I'm sorry

152
00:13:03,198 --> 00:13:10,594
What happened to the child that the mother tried to save?

153
00:13:10,594 --> 00:13:12,957
I was saved

154
00:13:12,957 --> 00:13:15,099
ah…

155
00:13:15,099 --> 00:13:19,693
(Osamu) That's... Tsumura-kun.

156
00:13:23,858 --> 00:13:29,363
This is the inmate list, and everything else I looked up.

157
00:13:29,363 --> 00:13:32,264
(Takagishi) I can't believe it...

158
00:13:34,132 --> 00:13:37,165
Can I make this into an article?

159
00:13:39,231 --> 00:13:46,033
(cell phone vibration sound)

160
00:13:46,033 --> 00:13:47,693
hello

161
00:13:47,693 --> 00:13:51,000
📱(Tsujimoto) Tsumura-san! I found Muroya!

162
00:14:12,495 --> 00:14:14,165
Yo

163
00:14:14,165 --> 00:14:20,759
♬〜

164
00:14:20,759 --> 00:14:25,264
Will you kill me again? (Tsujimoto) Tsumura-san, no!

165
00:14:25,264 --> 00:14:28,825
You won't kill me, huh?

166
00:14:28,825 --> 00:14:31,792
Testify.

167
00:14:31,792 --> 00:14:34,693
I'll testify that my memory was rewritten.

168
00:14:34,693 --> 00:14:36,363
presumed dead

169
00:14:36,363 --> 00:14:39,693
I wonder what Neurovice has done to me.

170
00:14:39,693 --> 00:14:50,198
♬〜

171
00:14:50,198 --> 00:14:52,594
(Tsujimoto) Mr. Kosaka...

172
00:14:53,693 --> 00:14:57,957
(Kousaka) What do you mean by giving him away?

173
00:14:57,957 --> 00:15:00,264
There's no point in letting him testify.

174
00:15:00,264 --> 00:15:02,957
Is it because you cover it up?

175
00:15:02,957 --> 00:15:07,858
Do you mean higher than me?

176
00:15:07,858 --> 00:15:10,660
You are also in danger

177
00:15:12,825 --> 00:15:15,066
Then just forget everything

178
00:15:15,066 --> 00:15:16,726
Are you telling me to cry myself to sleep?

179
00:15:16,726 --> 00:15:19,462
I didn't say that

180
00:15:19,462 --> 00:15:25,000
I also have no intention of continuing to obey the orders of those above me.

181
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,726
I need him for that

182
00:15:28,726 --> 00:15:31,330
I want you to leave it to me

183
00:15:31,330 --> 00:15:51,330
♬〜

184
00:15:51,330 --> 00:16:07,627
♬〜

185
00:16:07,627 --> 00:16:10,792
(chime)

186
00:16:18,264 --> 00:16:20,726
What about Mr. Ninomiya?

187
00:16:25,693 --> 00:16:27,495
something?

188
00:16:27,495 --> 00:16:29,495
no…

189
00:16:32,363 --> 00:16:39,726
Mr. Tsumura is probably trying to make accusations about what has happened so far.

190
00:16:39,726 --> 00:16:41,660
Ah... that's not the point

191
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:43,330
Let's help Ninomiya-san.

192
00:16:43,330 --> 00:16:46,627
That's not why I came

193
00:16:46,627 --> 00:16:51,429
He's... no more

194
00:16:51,429 --> 00:16:53,429
Huh?

195
00:16:55,462 --> 00:17:02,429
I just wanted you to look at me...

196
00:17:02,429 --> 00:17:06,660
It's a little creepy

197
00:17:09,033 --> 00:17:13,693
(Nanami) I wonder if she was planning to hide it all this time...

198
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:18,396
I think that's hard though.

199
00:17:18,396 --> 00:17:28,825
♬〜

200
00:17:28,825 --> 00:17:31,561
(Nanami) It's really weird.

201
00:17:31,561 --> 00:17:35,594
I was fooled about Yusuke Ninomiya.

202
00:17:35,594 --> 00:17:40,924
I'm actually so annoyed that I want to kill him...

203
00:17:44,759 --> 00:17:48,759
I'm grateful to Masaki Igawa.

204
00:17:50,660 --> 00:17:54,462
My memory is back...

205
00:17:54,462 --> 00:17:58,396
I even remembered things I didn't want to remember

206
00:18:00,396 --> 00:18:06,891
I didn't get along at all with my dead husband.

207
00:18:06,891 --> 00:18:10,000
Is that so (Nanami)?

208
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,891
Man's luck...

209
00:18:13,363 --> 00:18:20,363
...I don't think so. I don't have any luck.

210
00:18:20,363 --> 00:18:27,033
I don't have any memories of being loved by anyone...not even by my parents.

211
00:18:27,033 --> 00:18:31,891
But I felt love for you, didn't I?

212
00:18:35,396 --> 00:18:38,000
He loved me properly

213
00:18:40,462 --> 00:18:48,165
Well, that's also a memory made by Mr. Ninomiya.

214
00:18:48,165 --> 00:18:55,000
But being loved by someone

215
00:18:55,000 --> 00:19:04,429
Now that I know how happy I am, hehe

216
00:19:07,825 --> 00:19:09,825
Ah...

217
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:15,099
daughter

218
00:19:15,099 --> 00:19:23,033
♬〜

219
00:19:23,033 --> 00:19:26,726
That's cute haha

220
00:19:26,726 --> 00:19:30,957
I don't think you remember me.

221
00:19:30,957 --> 00:19:39,429
But I'm thinking of showering this child with so much love that I hate it.

222
00:19:39,429 --> 00:19:46,792
So much so that you start to hate me hehehehe

223
00:19:46,792 --> 00:19:48,462
(sound of breathing)

224
00:19:48,462 --> 00:19:57,132
Lastly, should I punch Ninomiya-san or just say thank you?

225
00:19:57,132 --> 00:20:00,660
I came here thinking of doing something...

226
00:20:00,660 --> 00:20:10,792
♬〜

227
00:20:18,495 --> 00:20:20,429
I want to talk

228
00:20:23,264 --> 00:20:25,561
It's all my fault

229
00:20:27,297 --> 00:20:30,000
I was arrested...

230
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:34,594
I thought it would be better if I wasn't around Yuri anymore.

231
00:20:34,594 --> 00:20:42,693
But it was a mistake, I ran away

232
00:20:42,693 --> 00:20:46,957
Could you give me another chance?

233
00:20:48,792 --> 00:20:54,231
I still think about Yuri... the one who loved me

234
00:20:54,231 --> 00:20:57,099
Was it because of my mother?

235
00:20:59,198 --> 00:21:01,198
I heard

236
00:21:02,891 --> 00:21:09,627
Mr. Tsumura was the one who was saved from the fire that killed his mother.

237
00:21:12,528 --> 00:21:16,066
After that, I spent some time counseling with Uncle Osamu.

238
00:21:16,066 --> 00:21:18,363
I was receiving it, right?

239
00:21:20,660 --> 00:21:24,561
Living comfortably at someone else's expense

240
00:21:24,561 --> 00:21:26,726
I can't stand it anymore

241
00:21:26,726 --> 00:21:29,891
So I feel responsible...

242
00:21:29,891 --> 00:21:35,957
different! It's true that the first time I found out was that person's daughter.

243
00:21:35,957 --> 00:21:41,033
I had mixed feelings, but as I learned more

244
00:21:41,033 --> 00:21:44,165
I really started to like Yuri.

245
00:21:44,165 --> 00:21:46,957
this is not a lie

246
00:21:46,957 --> 00:21:48,627
sorry

247
00:21:48,627 --> 00:21:53,297
Why Yuri... I'm the one who should apologize.

248
00:21:53,297 --> 00:21:55,726
Because of me, your mother... I'm sorry.

249
00:21:55,726 --> 00:21:59,726
Is that why you covered me? Huh?

250
00:22:03,627 --> 00:22:06,363
I can't remember anything.

251
00:22:08,495 --> 00:22:15,957
But... this is all I know.

252
00:22:20,033 --> 00:22:22,693
I…

253
00:22:22,693 --> 00:22:25,825
That Muroya punched a man.

254
00:22:25,825 --> 00:22:27,495
Sorry Yuri!

255
00:22:27,495 --> 00:22:32,495
It's enough that your life was ruined because of me!

256
00:22:32,495 --> 00:22:35,528
What do you like?

257
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:41,759
you loved me

258
00:22:43,594 --> 00:22:49,693
But I don't have that memory.Even if I try to remember, I can't.

259
00:22:51,957 --> 00:22:57,396
Even if I was told the truth, I still...

260
00:23:01,165 --> 00:23:05,198
still…

261
00:23:05,198 --> 00:23:08,693
I have nothing but happy memories with Yusuke.

262
00:23:13,330 --> 00:23:15,693
What should I do?

263
00:23:15,693 --> 00:23:21,825
♬〜

264
00:23:21,825 --> 00:23:26,000
sorry

265
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:28,330
Please stop it

266
00:23:28,330 --> 00:23:47,132
♬〜

267
00:23:50,264 --> 00:23:59,000
♬〜

268
00:24:02,934 --> 00:24:06,132
Ninomiya-san, I'm glad you're back (Rie) Ah...

269
00:24:06,132 --> 00:24:08,033
Instead you'll be blown away

270
00:24:08,033 --> 00:24:09,693
Huh? why?

271
00:24:09,693 --> 00:24:11,396
You made a photo of the Igawa couple, right?

272
00:24:11,396 --> 00:24:13,066
(Researcher) Yes

273
00:24:13,066 --> 00:24:15,693
Masaki Igawa's fingers were strangely extended

274
00:24:15,693 --> 00:24:19,165
No, that was an AI mistake... Huh? Ah...

275
00:24:20,363 --> 00:24:22,792
Open it! Open it!

276
00:24:22,792 --> 00:24:24,462
(unlock sound)

277
00:24:24,462 --> 00:24:36,792
♬〜

